DTEND:20261030T180000
DTSTAMP:20261024T150846Z
UID:3b6e355077d1b11d2d8bfe8e347616@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Apply by October 30th 2026! Are you that friend that everyone 
 goes to for advice? Do you consider yourself to be a good listener? Do you
  have an interest or passion for helping others? Are you thinking about a 
 career in psychology\, health sciences\, public health\, social work\, non
 -profit organization\, education\, or school counseling? The peer wellness
  coaching program is based on the belief that each person is an expert on 
