BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NSBE Fall Annual Conference 2026-27
DTSTART:20261119T150000
DTEND:20261123T040000
DTSTAMP:20261024T150847Z
UID:ec0434888ecedfa5025734c3efa39b@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:The NSBE (National Society of Black Engineers) Region 1 Confer
 ence is an annual gathering that brings together engineering students\, pr
 ofessionals\, and industry leaders from the northeastern United States. Th
 is vibrant conference focuses on fostering networking opportunities\, prof
 essional development\, and leadership skills among its members. Participan
 ts engage in a variety of workshops\, panel discussions\, and keynote spee
 ches\, covering topics such as innovation in engineering\, career advancem
 ent\, and diversity in the workforce. The conference also features a caree
 r fair\, connecting students with potential employers\, internship opportu
 nities\, and insights into industry trends. In addition to professional gr
 owth\, the NSBE Region 1 Conference celebrates the achievements of its mem
 bers and promotes community building through social events and chapter sho
 wcases. Overall\, it is an empowering experience that reinforces the impor
 tance of representation in STEM fields and encourages the next generation 
 of Black engineers to excel. --- Event Details: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp
 ?id=405727\n\nSource: Worcester Polytechnic Institute\nEvent page: https:/
 /mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=405727
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
URL:https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=405727
END:VEVENT
