UID:54c76662173c67809a56cfd2c58e57@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Join us for “The Assumptionist Charism on Campus & in the Wo
 rld: A Conversation with Father Peter Precourt\, AA” on Friday\, Novembe
 r 20\, from 3:00 p.m. to 4:30 p.m. in the Chapel of the Holy Spirit. As Fr
 . Peter Precourt AA prepares to celebrate 50 years of ordination\, we will
  interview him about his vocational path\, his ministry on the US/Mexico b
 order\, and his insights on how the Assumptionist charism speaks to the wo
 rld today\, particularly to our campus.\n\nSource: Assumption University\n
 Event page: https://www.assumption.edu/news-and-events/events/the-assumpti
 onist-charism-on-campus-in-the-world-a-conversation-with-father-peter-prec
 ourt-aa
